Applying it can have an effect on a monster, which I don't find useful 
except on one special unique monster.

Throwing them will break them, which will reduce your luck.  This can be 
beneficial in special circumstances when fooling with altars.

You can always polymorph them for a 1 in a billion chance at a magic marker 
or BoH.  :)

Otherwise, no, not very useful.

